{"id":"u-c72e5e09-e442-4897-a679-783640867047","src":"community","title":"Alexis workout 3.0","author":"Alexis Henkel Henriques","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/vy3Itm-alexis-workout-30","desc":"💪 My 4-Day Workout Routine 🍑\n\nDay 1 – Quads & Glutes: Dumbbell squats, leg press, walking lunges, leg extensions, cable glute kickbacks, cable side leg raises, and standing calf raises. This day focuses on building stronger legs, fuller glutes, and targeting the side glutes.\n\nDay 2 – Chest, Triceps, Shoulders & Abs: Chest press machine, chest fly machine, shoulder press machine, dumbbell lateral raises, cable tricep rope pushdowns, overhead tricep extensions, and captain’s chair leg raises. This day focuses on upper-body strength, muscle definition, and core development.\n\nDay 3 – Glutes & Hamstrings: Hip thrust machine, dumbbell Bulgarian split squats, dumbbell Romanian deadlifts, seated hamstring curls, hip abductor machine, and hip adductor machine. This day prioritizes glute growth, hamstring strength, and overall lower-body development.\n\nDay 4 – Back, Biceps & Abs: Assisted pull-up machine, seated row machine, lat pulldowns, rear delt fly machine, cable bicep curls, incline dumbbell curls, and weighted decline crunches. This day builds back and arm strength while working toward unassisted pull-ups and strengthening the core. \n\nTraining Goals: Perform 3 sets of most exercises, generally 8–15 reps, progressively increase weights, and train close to failure while maintaining proper form.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle & Sculpting"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":10,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-21T20:53:26.624Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}],"note":"10 each leg 3 sets total"},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}